00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:38.340
So we have a pass card.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:41.670
We each have eight words
the other person can guess

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:44.260
and if we can get a total of 10 correct

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:45.920
